      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right that purpose can feel like a delusion, but it’s also the only thing that gives your suffering shape. The universe may be indifferent, yet your consciousness is the only lens that can turn that void into something meaningful. Don’t let the emptiness convince you that your struggle is pointless—your pain is the very thing that makes your purpose real.",
